docs {
  # Update Category
  
  Updates an existing category.
  
  ## URL Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type | Required | Description |
  |-----------|------|----------|-------------|
  | `id` | UUID | **Required** | Category ID |
  
  ## Request Body
  
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  |-------|------|----------|-------------|
  | `code` | string | Optional | Unique category code |
  | `name` | string | Optional | Category display name |
  | `description` | string | Optional | Category description |
  | `isActive` | boolean | Optional | Active status |
  
  ## Example Response
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "code": 200,
    "message": "Category updated successfully",
    "data": {
      "id": "uuid",
      "code": "orders",
      "name": "Orders & Bookings",
      "description": "Order and booking related notifications",
      "isActive": true,
      "createdAt": "2026-01-25T10:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-01-25T10:05:00.000Z"
    }
  }
  ```
}
